<title>FRANCE: French Socialists to keep France Telecom.</title>
<headline>French Socialists to keep France Telecom.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Socialist Party spokesman Francois Hollande said on Tuesday that if his party won the election the government would keep 100 percent of France Telecom.</p>
<p>&quot;We have to remind us of the principle of 100 percent in the (public) services and that applies notably to France Telecom,&quot; he told Reuters by telephone.</p>
</text>
